sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Calculator UI
  participant BK as useBackends
  participant Api as calculatorApi
  participant NX as nginx
  participant J as backend-java
  participant G as backend-go
  UI->>BK: mount
  BK->>NX: GET /api/java/health + /api/go/health
  NX-->>BK: UP / UP
  BK-->>UI: active = java, selector visible
  User->>UI: 6 ÷ 3 =
  UI->>Api: calculate(divide, [6, 3], java)
  Api->>NX: POST /api/java/v1/calculate
  NX->>J: POST /api/v1/calculate
  alt java answers
    J-->>NX: 200 {"result":"2"}
    NX-->>Api: 200
    Api-->>UI: "2"
  else java unavailable (502 / timeout)
    NX-->>Api: 502
    Api->>BK: failover(java)
    BK->>NX: GET /api/go/health
    NX-->>BK: UP
    BK-->>Api: go (selector hidden)
    Api->>NX: POST /api/go/v1/calculate
    NX->>G: POST /api/v1/calculate
    G-->>NX: 200 {"result":"2"}
    NX-->>Api: 200
    Api-->>UI: "2"
  end
  UI-->>User: render display
